- `paint_tile_uv()` (`(uv − offset) × scale`), `paint_albedo()` (flag-gated sample, else `BASE_COLOR` constant). `shade()` takes `uv`; albedo feeds diffuse AND the specular F0. Both fragment entries pass `in.uv`. Solo base-color returns `paint_albedo(uv)`; **Unlit returns `paint_albedo(uv)` too** (was constant); all other solos/previews unchanged. The `VIEW_MODE_WGSL` and display-LUT blocks are byte-untouched (their verbatim tests still hold). `OPENPBR_SHADER` untouched.

**`crates/umber-gpu/src/renderer.rs`** (my surface)
