- Tests (6 new): `vertex_stays_32_bytes_with_the_uv_slot`, `paint_params_constructors_pin_the_tile_select` (both run in CI), and gpu-gated `paint_texture_sample_appears_in_solo_base_color` (the can-fail pin: 2×2 real `PaintTarget` via `write_region`, degenerate-UV fullscreen triangle, all 4 texels, ≤1 LSB), `unbound_paint_renders_the_constant_in_color_views` ([184,184,191,255]), `lit_mode_multiplies_the_bound_texture_by_light` (bound red ≈ (96,0,0) vs constant (69,75,98)), `clear_base_color_texture_restores_the_fallback` (byte-exact restore).
